%%{init: {"theme": "base", "themeVariables": {
  "primaryColor": "#f4f5ff", "primaryBorderColor": "#6b6fcf", "primaryTextColor": "#1d1d1f",
  "lineColor": "#6b6fcf", "actorBkg": "#ffffff", "actorBorder": "#6b6fcf", "actorTextColor": "#1d1d1f",
  "noteBkgColor": "#ffffff", "noteBorderColor": "#4fc98a", "noteTextColor": "#1d1d1f",
  "signalColor": "#444444", "signalTextColor": "#1d1d1f", "labelBoxBkgColor": "#ffffff",
  "labelBoxBorderColor": "#c8c8c8", "loopTextColor": "#444444", "sequenceNumberColor": "#ffffff"}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    box rgb(238,248,242) GUI thread
        participant W as AnalysisWindow
    end
    box rgb(244,245,255) Analysis thread
        participant K as AnalysisWorker
        participant H as HausdorffDistance<br/>and HausdorffStatistics
    end

    Note over W,K: The two shapes are selected, Compute is enabled

    W->>W: Compute: copy the shapes, images and options
    Note over W: the button is disabled and shows "Computing..."
    W-)K: submit(request)
    Note over W,K: queued command: only the latest request is kept

    K->>K: intersection of the two shapes
    K->>H: build with the shapes and the intersection
    H-->>K: distance, centroids, sorted minima
    K-->>W: analysisReady(result)

    alt the selection did not change
        W->>W: show the distances and the popup
        Note over W: the statistics are kept (shared, read only)
    else the selection changed meanwhile
        W->>W: ignore the outdated result
    end

    loop the percentile changes
        W->>W: quantile read from the kept statistics
        Note over W: no new computation, no thread
    end
